   285	def check_ladder(rungs, kind):
   286	    """None when the ladder is well formed, else the problem. An asset ladder written from Strongly bearish up to
   287	    Strongly bullish (the model often orders a revenue ladder by rising value) is the same ladder; normalise_ladder
   288	    turns it round. Labels are compared in the canonical vocabulary."""
